; Pump-action shotgun placeholder viewmodel, assembled from primitives.
; Local space matches the other weapons: barrel fires along -Z, +Y up. Roughly
; life-size (~1.15m long).
;
; A plain field gun rather than a trench gun: no heat shield, no pistol grip.
; The stock runs straight from butt to receiver, and the support hand sits on a
; ribbed "corncob" forend that slides on the magazine tube. The only sight is a
; bead at the muzzle -- RearSight is a bare marker on the receiver's top line,
; so the aim solve still has two points to put on the camera's centre line.
